{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>If Elohim will be with me.</b> If He will keep for me these promises that He promised me — to be with me, as He said to me: ״וְהִנֵּה אָנֹכִי עִמָּךְ״." "<b>And will keep me.</b> As He said to me: ״וּשְׁמַרְתִּיךָ בְּכֹל אֲשֶׁר תֵּלֵךְ״." "<b>And will give me bread to eat.</b> As He said: ״כִּי לֹא אֶעֱזָבְךָ״ — and one who seeks bread is called נֶעֱזָב, as it says: ״וְלֹא רָאִיתִי צַדִּיק נֶעֱזָב וְזַרְעוֹ מְבַקֵּשׁ לָחֶם״ (Psalms 37)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:59.925433050Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}